#                           THIS FILE USES THE FOLLOWING FORMAT
# 1: BATTLETYPE
# 2: BIGSPRITE
# 3: HANDSPRITE
# 4: FLOORSPRITE
# 5: FIRESOUND
# 6: BULLETSPRITE
# 7: BULLETSPEED
# 8: INVWIDTH
# 9: INVHEIGHT
# 10: TWOHANDED
# 11: ARMOR
# 12: COMPATIBLEAMMO
# 13: ATTRACTION (OPTIONAL)
#
# WEAPON PERFORMANCE, TAGS, AND OTHER BALANCE ATTRIBUTES ARE LOCATED IN BALLISTICS_PLAYERSLAANESH.RUL
# PRICE, REQUIREMENT, & AVAILABILITY ATTRIBUTES ARE LOCATED IN ITEMREQUIREMENTS.PLAYERSLAANESH.RUL
#
